  (label "VP  (+5 V drive rail)" (at 38.0 50.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e1998c66-a37a-4c93-b489-6aba0ce9775a"))
  (label "OUT  (to HEMT gate)" (at 38.0 110.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02664856-17ee-4161-86fe-fcd12f02b231"))
  (label "VN  (off rail: 0 V or -2 V)" (at 38.0 170.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87cbd8ef-58b9-4e0e-915a-1ed3e2b2c941"))
  (label "ACTIVE MILLER CLAMP" (at 246.0 126.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b7f062d-35d1-45f0-b907-58d1572034dd"))
  (text "Segmented gate driver - one side of the half-bridge, as simulated" (at 36 22 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b512246f-10bc-4821-85f1-2328cf8a6134"))
  (text "models/segdrv.lib.  8 pull-up slices, 8 pull-down, clamp, selectable off rail." (at 36 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0f88545e-96b8-4c04-8f5b-d6b50d87dad4"))
  (text "EACH SLICE IS A SWITCH AND A RESISTOR, AND THE RESISTOR CARRIES THE CODE." (at 36 196 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "36bf7a5b-e48c-4338-a0cc-373b3b5ad094"))
  (text "In the netlist slice 3 of the pull-up bank reads:" (at 36 200.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dd902b22-6aa2-454f-9768-28a77e8d42c4"))
  (text "    Rpu3 nu3 out {runit + (npu>=3 ? 0 : 1e9)}" (at 36 204.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "744b1d7a-bd85-4f13-90e1-d863465be1f5"))
  (text "Ask for three or more slices and Rpu3 is runit, 8 ohm, in circuit. Ask for fewer" (at 36 209.20000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d98f0bca-4e3e-4e75-807f-08d59e7a25af"))
  (text "and it becomes 1 Gohm, which is that slice switched out. Drive strength is" (at 36 213.60000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d0e40ff-1d8a-4535-8f7a-81eac673e189"))
  (text "therefore how many of the eight parallel 8 ohm paths are live: 8 ohm at npu=1," (at 36 218.00000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b0b5b661-6910-4952-98f8-eaecb731c961"))
  (text "down to 1 ohm at npu=8. The switches are voltage-controlled (.model SWP," (at 36 222.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cb443b18-9950-45df-bdc7-7030099e9cb5"))
  (text "Ron 0.01, Roff 1e9) - a behavioural stand-in for the real output transistors," (at 36 226.80000000000004 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bf20645d-917b-4d4d-b584-f423f24211c1"))
  (text "which is stated here rather than implied." (at 36 231.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3efac7fb-f2a6-45c8-adda-886e27cee68d"))
  (text "" (at 36 235.60000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "32852bb6-7abd-470d-86f3-a796d50ed816"))
  (text "WHAT IS OURS RATHER THAN THE BASE PAPER'S.  Sclk and Rclk on the right are the" (at 36 240.00000000000006 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "43d56968-90e6-4e84-88cb-7a0e9ed5cfb4"))
  (text "active Miller clamp: it pulls the gate to the off rail through 0.5 ohm whenever" (at 36 244.40000000000006 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "954e806b-f471-4ab7-a734-6335ae161b86"))
  (text "the device should be off. VN is selectable to -2 V. models/zhangdrv.lib, the" (at 36 248.80000000000007 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2d767432-6fe8-4b96-a6be-72c10902e5c7"))
  (text "base paper built in the same testbench, has neither; its file says so in as many" (at 36 253.20000000000007 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ffebdd8-03f1-4048-b68e-857f596737db"))
  (text "words. Of the crosstalk margin the clamp is worth +0.82 V and the negative rail" (at 36 257.6000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e75d4130-8c7c-41e3-a430-ff920fe8031d"))
  (text "a further +2.01 V. The eight slices - the part everyone builds - cost 0.00 %" (at 36 262.00000000000006 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7171bbe7-2aa1-4170-aef5-b933027f2197"))
  (text "to freeze." (at 36 266.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "263dea3c-8d26-4430-b214-1983762b964c"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
